{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1524490-glorious-solar-plate-glorioussolar-sabre-immaculate-golden-bow-evocations","id":1524490,"title":"Glorious Solar Plate, GloriousSolar Sabre, Immaculate golden bow Evocations?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-24T16:58:45-07:00","id":1524490,"title":"Glorious Solar Plate, GloriousSolar Sabre, Immaculate golden bow Evocations?","content":"How to go about it? should I Use evocations for Orichulam as a base?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-24T18:45:43-07:00","id":1524494,"title":"","content":"I'd be writing Evocations to express the Solar's nature through the lens of the Solar tree it stems from, with side-lean into other Solar trees important to the Solar.<br /> So a Performance-heavy and self-sacrificially compassionate Solar's Glorious Solar Plate might evoke Evocations that include: Efficiently boosting defenses when Defend Other'ing, rolling Performance to quell a foe's anger or hostility when they strike her, outright taking a hit for someone else no roll needed, shattering the Plate to wreath her allies in a lesser version, opening the ability to roll Performance to convince her foes she's invincible, or reflexively activating a berserker-Charm if an ally is seriously injured. They're all Resistance-ish effects, but I hope the Solar's themes and other focuses shine through in them.<br /> <br /> All that said, Orichalcum is a pretty decent set of themes to mug. My main point is that it's a particular Ability's effect primarily, but if it's more fun to drift away into something else then by all means pitch it to your table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}